        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "body": "Can you also add a comment here explaining why the flag is important and the ramifications it has?\n\nSome points:\n- `_Py_LOCK_DONT_DETACH` prevents the outer CS to get released while the keys' mutex is locked\n- must not acquire more locks in this CS (must be the top-most critical section)\n- @colesbury maybe you want to expand on the rationale for this as well?",
